\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">缝；缝纫；缝制；穿行；迂回前进</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217640\">これを<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>縫<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ったんですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">是用手缝的吗？ <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/13108745\" title=\"Tatoeba · LeviHighway\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · LeviHighway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">抜かす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬかす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">省略；遗漏；跳过；超过；超越；超车；说；讲</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76486\">は？グダグダ<ruby>抜<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かすんじゃねぇ。それでもオトコか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">别这么发牢骚,你自称是男人!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">抜く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">拔出；抽出；提取；拔掉；除草；省略；遗漏；省掉；跳过；彻底地做；充分地做；完全地做；使劲地做；放出；排出；排空；排干；挑选；选择；精选；选出；偷取；窃取；除去；去掉；清除；取出；超过；超越；赶过；领先；刺穿；突破；穿过；剪裁；裁剪；用防染法染出图案；夺取；攻占；攻陷；抢先发表；独家报道；（围棋）提子；吃掉对方的棋子；（男性）自慰；（自慰时）射精；拍摄；录制</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"170547\"><ruby>最後<rp>(</rp><rt>さいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まで<ruby>戦<rp>(</rp><rt>たたか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>抜<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">让我们战斗到最后。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">脱ぐ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬぐ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">脱掉；脱下；脱去</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224569\">ここで<ruby>靴<rp>(</rp><rt>くつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>脱<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がなければなりませんか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我要在这里脱鞋吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">抜け出す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬけだす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">溜出；偷偷溜走；突破脱困；冲到前面；取得领先；领先；（如头发）开始脱落；跳出循环；从循环中退出</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75217\">あ、みんなには<ruby>内緒<rp>(</rp><rt>ないしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だよ？<ruby>寮<rp>(</rp><rt>りょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>夜中<rp>(</rp><rt>よなか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>抜<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>け<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すのは<ruby>厳罰<rp>(</rp><rt>げんばつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だからね？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那是个秘密,因为晚上从宿舍溜出去 会受到严厉惩罚</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">抜ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">脱落；掉落；遗漏；缺失；逃脱；松开；褪色；变色；磨破；穿破（如衣服）；离开；退出（如会议）；清澈；透明（如天空）；心不在焉；粗心；不专心；愚蠢；退出循环（程序）；穿过；通过；垮掉；倒塌；得分超过88分而获胜（不含得分组合的积分）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231162\">あの<ruby>歌<rp>(</rp><rt>うた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>頭<rp>(</rp><rt>あたま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>抜<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けなくて。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我无法把那首歌从脑海中抹去</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">盗み</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬすみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">盗窃；偷窃；盗取</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209042\">その<ruby>少年<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>盗<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みをしかねない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这孩子有抢劫的能力</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">盗む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬすむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">偷；盗取；抄袭；窃取（技巧、想法等）；暗中学习；偷偷地做；悄悄地进行；在匆忙中抽时间做；利用片刻时间做；盗垒</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124148\"><ruby>盗<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まれたお<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があきらめられない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不会放弃偷来的钱</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">布</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬの</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">布料；织物；纺织品；布币（中国古代铲形铜币）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220078\">この<ruby>布<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>値段<rp>(</rp><rt>ねだん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>割<rp>(</rp><rt>わり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>品質<rp>(</rp><rt>ひんしつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>良<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这种布的质价很高</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">沼</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬま</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">沼泽；湿地；泥沼；池塘；痴迷；沉溺；上瘾；丑男；相貌丑陋的男人；智障；精神残疾人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209007\">その<ruby>沼<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはサギがたくさん<ruby>住<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">很多牧羊人住在沼泽里</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">濡らす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬらす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">弄湿；润湿；打湿；浸湿；蘸</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"112074\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はタオルを<ruby>水<rp>(</rp><rt>みず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>濡<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他用水湿了毛巾</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">塗る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">涂；涂抹；敷；上漆；刷；贴（壁纸）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"215528\">ジョンがドアにペンキを<ruby>塗<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">约翰在画门</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">温い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬるい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">温热的；不冷不热的；微温的；宽松的；宽容的；不严厉的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223801\">このコーヒーはぬるいです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这咖啡不够热</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ぬれる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">被浸湿；受潮；沾湿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"80133\"><ruby>木<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のおかげで<ruby>雨<rp>(</rp><rt>あめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にぬれずにすんだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">树让我没有下雨</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ね</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">价格；价钱；成本；价值；价值；优点</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"113046\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>絵<rp>(</rp><rt>え</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にたいへん<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>値<rp>(</rp><rt>ね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をつけた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他把画的价钱非常高</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lan